# Old-site URLs that Google still crawls. Read by Cloudflare's static assets.
# Each points at the closest real page; a blanket redirect to the homepage
# reads as a soft 404. Old URLs with no equivalent page are left to 404.
# /index.html and trailing slashes (/contact/) are redirected by Cloudflare's
# default html_handling, so they need no rule here.
/about-us       /about          301
/work           /case-studies   301
/careers/openings  /careers#openings  301
/work/          /case-studies   301
# Until the /services pages exist (Phase 2.3). Then repoint to /services.
/services       /               301
/services/      /               301
# Removed: /platform, /insights, /content/* and /creators/* now return 404.
# /creators/* comes back as curated category pages in Phase 3.9.
